Depends: ibus (>= 1.5.27), ibus-gtk3, ibus-gtk4, libxcb1, libxcb-xinput0, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Ngó Sen for GNOME, a Vietnamese input method for IBus
 Ngó Sen for GNOME types Vietnamese through IBus, the input method GNOME
 comes with. The word being typed is underlined until it is done.
